this is a mobile app which vibrates to let a person know if there is an Emergency. It can only be logged into google as it requires Gemini AI to run. So when the person logs into google, it automatically connects gemini to the Application and the gemini runs 24/7 while Audio intake. so like if a person like "I'm going to Olive Garden", the AI hears it and puts direction to nearest "Olive Garden". if he says "Olive Garden" of a specific place, the directions is to "Olive garden" to that specific place. During An emergency, if it hears sounds like distress and all, it notifies the authorities(here the authority is a given phone number), Vibrates strongly, creates a popup which cant be overriden until the person is away from the proximity range, and create loud beeping or siren noise(can be chosen by user. this is prototype so the sound can be reduced), here the proximity depends on the severity of the emergency like earthquakes may require 1km or more while accidents may require 30-40 meters. also cant be overriden until user away from proximity). During General use, it has live translation (like our default is english. the other person doesnt know english so this 24/7 AI audio intake tries to identify the person's language by how they respond to the user). 
